Or this is one video
that you're really trying

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.703
to get the attention of somebody with

00:09:32.703 --> 00:09:35.175
and your support of commenting or sharing

00:09:35.175 --> 00:09:36.259
would really, really help me.

00:09:36.259 --> 00:09:38.379
If it feels like a heartfelt message.

00:09:38.379 --> 00:09:41.214
People want to support
other people's dreams.

00:09:41.214 --> 00:09:43.126
And especially if it's only a view.

00:09:43.126 --> 00:09:44.696
It's only a comment and you're not asking

00:09:44.696 --> 00:09:46.618
for somebody to give you money for it.

00:09:46.618 --> 00:09:48.954
Then it can really help get that channel

00:09:48.954 --> 00:09:50.054
to where you want it to go.

00:09:50.054 --> 00:09:52.791
So get your friends
involved and ask for help.

