00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.619
Whatever idea you have,
whatever your message is.

00:10:10.619 --> 00:10:12.920
Whatever level of expertise you have.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:15.554
You can make a top 10
list, a top seven list

00:10:15.554 --> 00:10:17.897
a top eight ways, a top nine secrets.

00:10:17.897 --> 00:10:19.433
Making a listicle video

00:10:19.433 --> 00:10:21.498
helps make it easy for people to digest

00:10:21.498 --> 00:10:23.928
and when people see numbers in a video

00:10:23.928 --> 00:10:25.869
