00:10:25.869 --> 00:10:27.117
for whatever reason.

00:10:27.117 --> 00:10:28.862
So try to take that
expertise that you have

00:10:28.862 --> 00:10:30.042
those opinions that you have

00:10:30.042 --> 00:10:31.473
and form it in a list

00:10:31.473 --> 00:10:32.929
and make that video.

00:10:32.929 --> 00:10:35.457
It's much more likely to
stand out and succeed.

00:10:35.457 --> 00:10:37.763
So those are my seven
ways to get your first

00:10:37.763 --> 00:10:39.494
